{{dercat|en|ine-pro|inh=1}}

{{inh+|en|enm|god}}, from {{inh|en|ang|god}}, originally neuter, then changed to masculine to reflect the change in religion to Christianity, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*god|g=n}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gudą}}; see there for further origin. Not related to the word {{m|en|good}} or {{noncog|fa|خدا||god|tr=xodâ}}.

